    <authors>farag2</authors>
    <owners>Xav83</owners>
    <summary>The most powerful PowerShell module on GitHub for Windows 10 and Windows 11 fine-tuning and tweaking</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Sophia Script for Windows is the largest PowerShell module on GitHub for Windows 10 and Windows 11 fine-tuning and automating the routine tasks.

## Editions

Sophia Script ships one edition per Windows version. This package installs the edition matching your system:

- **Windows 11** (x64 or Arm): the Windows 11 script, whose version is the package version;
- **Windows 10**: the Windows 10 script, which has its own version number (for example 7.1.0 for package 8.1.0).

The LTSC and PowerShell 7 editions are not installed by this package; download them from the [releases page](https://github.com/farag2/Sophia-Script-for-Windows/releases).
]]></description>
